WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:02.868
Give your raw idea to the agent and ask for a structured

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:03.320
mirror.

00:00:03.704 --> 00:00:05.735
Compare its description to what you intended.

00:00:06.118 --> 00:00:09.311
Check the people involved, the trigger, the actions, and

00:00:09.346 --> 00:00:10.147
the final state.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.527
Correct an assumption or ambiguity.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:15.824
Record the final agreed statement and any unresolved

00:00:15.859 --> 00:00:16.474
questions.

00:00:16.915 --> 00:00:19.388
A fresh reader should be able to distinguish what you

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:21.989
actually said from what the agent suggested.

00:00:22.372 --> 00:00:25.367
If a decision is already settled, include its source

00:00:25.449 --> 00:00:28.479
rather than forcing an unnecessary repeat discussion.
